  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPractice Management \n\t\tPractice Management Help Guide\n\n### Uploading Multiple Documents in Practice Management\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 30 Jun, 2026 at 12:38 PM\n\nThe maximum file/s upload is 20MB\n\nPlease also note, you can now upload zip files.\n\nCreating a ZIP file allows you to:\n\nCombine multiple files into a single file.\nReduce file size for easier sharing.\nUpload multiple documents at once.\nKeep related files organised in one place.\nSpeed up file transfers and downloads.\n\n### Creating a ZIP File on Windows\n\nLocate the files or folders you want to compress.\nSelect one or multiple files.\nRight-click your selection.\nSelect Send to > Compressed (zipped) folder.\nWindows will create a new ZIP file in the same location.\nEnter a name for the ZIP file and press Enter.\nYour ZIP file is now ready to be shared or uploaded.\n\n### Creating a ZIP File on macOS\n\nLocate the files or folders you wish to compress.\nSelect the required items.\nRight-click (or Control-click) the selection.\nClick Compress.\nIf you compress a single file, macOS creates filename.zip.\nIf you compress multiple files, macOS creates Archive.zip, which you can rename if required.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115348\">Practice Management </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188563\">Practice Management Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Uploading Multiple Documents in Practice Management\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 30 Jun, 2026 at 12:38 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p></p><div style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/91ba385869ea414b847e04f16a039638?sid=a74269f2-5e96-4a91-b17c-6e2c83bd5dbb\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\"></iframe></div><p></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">The maximum file/s upload is 20MB<br><br>Please also note, you can now upload zip files.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Creating a ZIP file allows you to:</span></p><ul data-spread=\"false\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><li style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Combine multiple files into a single file.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Reduce file size for easier sharing.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Upload multiple documents at once.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Keep related files organised in one place.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Speed up file transfers and downloads.</span></span></li></ul><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><hr></span></span></div><h1 style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Creating a ZIP File on Windows</span></span></h1><ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><li style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Locate the files or folders you want to compress.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Select one or multiple files.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Right-click your selection.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Select&nbsp;<strong>Send to</strong> &gt;&nbsp;<strong>Compressed (zipped) folder</strong>.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Windows will create a new ZIP file in the same location.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Enter a name for the ZIP file and press&nbsp;<strong>Enter</strong>.</span></span></li></ol><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Your ZIP file is now ready to be shared or uploaded.</span></span></p><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><hr></span></span></div><h1 style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Creating a ZIP File on macOS</span></span></h1><ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><li style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Locate the files or folders you wish to compress.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Select the required items.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Right-click (or Control-click) the selection.</span></span></li><li style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Click&nbsp;<strong>Compress</strong>.</span></span></li></ol><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">If you compress a single file, macOS creates&nbsp;<strong>filename.zip</strong>.</span></span></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">If you compress multiple files, macOS creates&nbsp;<strong>Archive.zip</strong>, which you can rename if required.</span></li></ul>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000233105\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000233105/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000233105\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000233105/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000233105\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">Send feedback</a><div id=\"vote-feedback-container\"class=\"hide\">\t<div class=\"lead\">Sorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.</div>\t<div id=\"vote-feedback-form\">\t\t<div class=\"sloading loading-small loading-block\"></div>\t</div></div>\n\t\t\n"
